---
import Icon from "@/components/Icon.astro";
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[350px] sm:w-[600px] h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] bg-primary/15 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center max-w-3xl z-10">
    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[3rem] p-8 sm:p-14 md:p-16 border-2 border-primary/40 shadow-glow-primary bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-card/95 via-brand-card/80 to-brand-card/95">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary/20 border border-primary/35 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-orange-200 text-xs font-bold">
        <Icon name="sparkles" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400" />
        Lista en 3 minutos
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight font-display">
        Tus clientes piden la música. <br />
        <span class="text-gradient">Tu equipo vende más.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-zinc-100 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        Repítela recibe las canciones desde el QR de cada mesa y tú mantienes el control.
        <br />
        <span class="text-white font-black">$50.000 COP/mes. Sin contratos ni cláusulas.</span>
      </p>

      <div class="flex justify-center max-w-md mx-auto">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/573028336170?text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20llevar%20Repitela%20a%20mi%20bar"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-track-location="cta_final"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 h-11 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-emerald-700 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg py-6 sm:py-7 rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          <Icon name="message-circle" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0" />
          Pide una demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
